          <span class="rrow-ver">v0.4.0</span>
          <span class="chip chip--minor">リリース</span>
          <span class="chip" title="Original English release note">EN</span>
        </div>
        <p class="rrow-sum">深夜，代码在屏幕上闪烁。你刚结束第17次调试，那个本该智能对话的AI代理却像失忆的老人，反复询问相同的问题。团队群里的消息不断弹出：&quot;客户投诉响应迟钝&quot;&quot;竞争对手的AI已经能处理复杂工单了&quot;。你揉了揉发胀的太阳穴，意识到传统开发方式正在吞噬你的生命。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rrow-side" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="rrow-arrow" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
      </div>
    </a><a class="rrow" href="https://www.stags.cn/releases/openai-agents-python/0.2.8" data-row>
      <time class="rrow-date">—</time>
